### KrakenD AI Gateway - sample requests
### Open in VS Code and click "Send Request" above each block (REST Client extension).
### In a Codespace, localhost:8080 is the gateway. No API keys go in these requests -
### the gateway injects them from your Codespaces secrets.

@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/__health

### Demo backend (no key needed) - response filtered to id/title/completed
GET {{base}}/demo/todos/1

############################################################
# Community + Enterprise: transparent AI proxy (native payloads)
############################################################

### OpenAI - list models (cheap key check)
GET {{base}}/llm/openai/v1/models

### OpenAI - chat completions
POST {{base}}/llm/openai/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-5-nano",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Explain an API gateway in one sentence." }
  ]
}

### Anthropic - messages
POST {{base}}/llm/anthropic/v1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "claude-haiku-4-5",
  "max_tokens": 256,
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Explain an API gateway in one sentence." }
  ]
}

############################################################
# Enterprise only (needs LICENSE): unified AI Gateway interface
# Same request + response shape regardless of vendor.
############################################################

### Unified -> OpenAI
POST {{base}}/ai/openai
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instructions": "Act as a 1000 dollar consultant. Be brief.",
  "contents": "Tell me a consultant joke"
}

### Unified -> Anthropic
POST {{base}}/ai/anthropic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instructions": "Act as a 1000 dollar consultant. Be brief.",
  "contents": "Tell me a consultant joke"
}

### Header-based routing -> OpenAI
POST {{base}}/ai/multi
Content-Type: application/json
X-LLM: openai

{
  "contents": "Which LLM vendor are you from? One sentence."
}

### Header-based routing -> fallback (Anthropic)
POST {{base}}/ai/multi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contents": "Which LLM vendor are you from? One sentence."
}
